        <mxCell id="ci-blog" value="&lt;b&gt;blogLosAngeles (spec 001)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;delivery (PRs + main): Prepare → Maintain content → Build (1× hugo) → Checks {tests · security · seo} → Infrastructure (terraform/**) → Deploy (main, no blocking failure) → Verify&lt;br&gt;site health (main only, alert never block): data-health daily · security-live after deploy + weekly · seo-live-crawl weekly&lt;br&gt;rules: ci/checks.yml → docs/ci-gates.md · Grafana “CI — blog delivery” + ci_site_health_failing" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
